{
    "name": "E2E Zoho Books - find invoices and record payment",
    "description": "Creates a customer and an invoice, marks it sent, finds it with Find Invoices, records a payment against it, asserts the results and deletes payment, invoice and customer.",
    "notes": {
        "39bbf2f7-93eb-4c16-b173-9ba0a90cb7ee": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 512,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 240,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\n**Organization ID** `20111141498` is set on every Zoho Books component, including the MakeApiCall cleanup (Query Parameters). It must be an organization of the connected Zoho Books account — on another tenant replace it everywhere.\n\nThe invoice is marked as sent before the payment: Zoho Books does not apply payments to draft invoices. The payment is deleted before the invoice because an invoice with a payment cannot be deleted. If the flow stops half way, delete the customer *Appmixer E2E payment customer …* and its records by hand."
        }
    },
